;*
;* an$ = text that was typed *
;* w$ = text that was wrapped *
;* location (chat) holds:
;*
;* 0 = normal *
;* 1 = delete on column one *
;* or dot on column one *
;* 2 = chat check hit *
;* 3 = carrier/time loss *
